---
import MainLayout from '@/layouts/MainLayout.astro';
---

<MainLayout title="E5 Wheels - About Us">
  <div class="w-full bg-white pb-24">
    <!-- Hero Section -->
    <section class="container-e5 py-20">
      <div class="max-w-[1200px] mx-auto">
        <!-- Header -->
        <div class="text-center mb-16">
          <h1 class="text-[#d31d25] text-[28px] md:text-[36px] lg:text-[42px] xl:text-[48px] font-['Franklin_Gothic_Book'] tracking-[5.6px] md:tracking-[7.2px] lg:tracking-[8.4px] xl:tracking-[9.6px] uppercase mb-6 leading-tight px-6 md:px-12">
            ABOUT E5 WHEELS
          </h1>
          <div class="w-full h-[2px] bg-[#d31d25] mb-8"></div>
          <p class="text-black text-[16px] md:text-[18px] lg:text-[20px] xl:text-[24px] font-['Franklin_Gothic_Book'] leading-[22px] md:leading-[24px] lg:leading-[26px] xl:leading-[30px] tracking-[1.6px] px-6 md:px-12">
            The Fifth Element of Corvette Performance
          </p>
        </div>

        <!-- Our Story Section -->
        <div class="mb-16">
          <h2 class="text-[#d31d25] text-[24px] md:text-[28px] lg:text-[32px] xl:text-[36px] font-['Franklin_Gothic_Demi'] tracking-[4.8px] md:tracking-[5.6px] lg:tracking-[6.4px] xl:tracking-[7.2px] uppercase mb-6">
            Our Story
          </h2>
          <div class="space-y-6 text-black/70 text-[14px] md:text-[16px] lg:text-[18px] xl:text-[20px] leading-[24px] md:leading-[28px]">
            <p>
              E5 Wheels was born from a simple belief: Corvette owners deserve wheels built exclusively for Corvettes. Not truck wheels adapted for sports cars. Not universal fitments stretched to work. Purpose-built wheels engineered from the ground up for C6, C7, and C8 Corvette owners who refuse to compromise.
            </p>
            <p>
              Our name tells our story. E5 stands for Element 5, inspired by the classical elements of Earth, Water, Air, and Fire. The fifth element? The Corvette itself—a force of nature that transcends ordinary automotive engineering. When you drive a Corvette, you're experiencing something elemental, something pure. Our wheels are designed to honor that spirit.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- 40+ Years Section -->
        <div class="mb-16">
          <h2 class="text-[#d31d25] text-[24px] md:text-[28px] lg:text-[32px] xl:text-[36px] font-['Franklin_Gothic_Demi'] tracking-[4.8px] md:tracking-[5.6px] lg:tracking-[6.4px] xl:tracking-[7.2px] uppercase mb-6">
            40+ Years of Wheel Industry Excellence
          </h2>
          <div class="space-y-6 text-black/70 text-[14px] md:text-[16px] lg:text-[18px] xl:text-[20px] leading-[24px] md:leading-[28px]">
            <p>
              E5 Wheels isn't our first chapter in the wheel industry—it's the culmination of over four decades of innovation. Our founder started American Force Wheels in 2003, building it into one of the most respected names in forged truck wheels. That same commitment to quality, precision engineering, and relentless innovation now drives everything we do at E5.
            </p>
            <p>
              We've spent 40 years perfecting the art and science of wheel manufacturing. We've invested in the machines, developed the processes, and assembled the team to produce wheels that meet the highest standards in the industry. When we decided to focus exclusively on Corvettes, we brought all of that expertise to bear on a single mission: creating the finest custom Corvette wheels available anywhere.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Why Corvette Section -->
        <div class="mb-16">
          <h2 class="text-[#d31d25] text-[24px] md:text-[28px] lg:text-[32px] xl:text-[36px] font-['Franklin_Gothic_Demi'] tracking-[4.8px] md:tracking-[5.6px] lg:tracking-[6.4px] xl:tracking-[7.2px] uppercase mb-6">
            Why We Focus Exclusively on Corvette
          </h2>
          <div class="space-y-6 text-black/70 text-[14px] md:text-[16px] lg:text-[18px] xl:text-[20px] leading-[24px] md:leading-[28px]">
            <p>
              You didn't choose just any car. You chose a Corvette for its power, prestige, and personality. A vehicle that represents the pinnacle of American performance engineering. At E5, we believe your wheels should match that commitment to excellence.
            </p>
            <p>
              By focusing exclusively on Corvettes, we've achieved something rare in the aftermarket wheel industry: true specialization. Every wheel we design, every fitment we engineer, every finish we perfect is optimized specifically for Corvette applications. We know the exact specifications of every C6, C7, and C8 model—from the base Stingray to the track-focused ZR1. This singular focus allows us to deliver fitments that fill your wheel wells perfectly, creating the aggressive, refined stance that Corvette owners demand.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Precision Engineering Section -->
        <div class="mb-16">
          <h2 class="text-[#d31d25] text-[24px] md:text-[28px] lg:text-[32px] xl:text-[36px] font-['Franklin_Gothic_Demi'] tracking-[4.8px] md:tracking-[5.6px] lg:tracking-[6.4px] xl:tracking-[7.2px] uppercase mb-6">
            Precision Engineering, Perfect Fitment
          </h2>
          <div class="space-y-6 text-black/70 text-[14px] md:text-[16px] lg:text-[18px] xl:text-[20px] leading-[24px] md:leading-[28px]">
            <p>
              At E5, we understand that fitment is everything. A wheel that doesn't fit precisely isn't just aesthetically disappointing—it compromises performance, handling, and safety. That's why every E5 wheel is engineered with hub-centric designs that ensure optimal performance, stability, and a superior driving experience.
            </p>
            <p>
              Our wheels feature precisely calculated offsets measured in millimeters to sit flush with your fenders for a clean, proportional appearance. Wider wheel options allow for larger tire setups, giving your Corvette enhanced grip and a muscular presence. Whether you're running factory tire pressure sensors, OEM lug nuts, or Corvette center caps, our wheels integrate seamlessly with your vehicle.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Wheels for Every Generation Section -->
        <div class="mb-16">
          <h2 class="text-[#d31d25] text-[24px] md:text-[28px] lg:text-[32px] xl:text-[36px] font-['Franklin_Gothic_Demi'] tracking-[4.8px] md:tracking-[5.6px] lg:tracking-[6.4px] xl:tracking-[7.2px] uppercase mb-6">
            Wheels for Every Corvette Generation
          </h2>
          <div class="space-y-4 text-black/70 text-[14px] md:text-[16px] lg:text-[18px] xl:text-[20px] leading-[24px] md:leading-[28px]">
            <p>
              <strong class="text-black">C6 Corvette (2005-2013):</strong> Base, Grand Sport, Z06, and ZR1
            </p>
            <p>
              <strong class="text-black">C7 Corvette (2014-2019):</strong> Stingray, Grand Sport, Z06, and ZR1
            </p>
            <p>
              <strong class="text-black">C8 Corvette (2020+):</strong> Stingray, Z06, E-Ray, and ZR1
            </p>
            <p class="mt-6">
              Each model has unique specifications and styling cues. Our team designs wheels that complement and elevate the distinctive character of every Corvette variant—from the refined elegance of a base Stingray to the aggressive stance of a widebody Z06.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Race-Proven Performance Section -->
        <div class="mb-16">
          <h2 class="text-[#d31d25] text-[24px] md:text-[28px] lg:text-[32px] xl:text-[36px] font-['Franklin_Gothic_Demi'] tracking-[4.8px] md:tracking-[5.6px] lg:tracking-[6.4px] xl:tracking-[7.2px] uppercase mb-6">
            Race-Proven Performance
          </h2>
          <div class="space-y-6 text-black/70 text-[14px] md:text-[16px] lg:text-[18px] xl:text-[20px] leading-[24px] md:leading-[28px]">
            <p>
              For Corvette owners who demand the ultimate in performance, E5 offers forged drag racing wheels built for high-horsepower applications. Our racing lineup features aerospace-grade construction, double and single beadlock options, and custom titanium hardware designed to handle the most extreme conditions.
            </p>
            <p>
              All E5 racing wheels meet or exceed SAE J2530 and SFI 15.1/15.2 standards. Because when you're pushing the limits of what's possible, you need wheels engineered to keep pace.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Our Commitment Section -->
        <div class="mb-16">
          <h2 class="text-[#d31d25] text-[24px] md:text-[28px] lg:text-[32px] xl:text-[36px] font-['Franklin_Gothic_Demi'] tracking-[4.8px] md:tracking-[5.6px] lg:tracking-[6.4px] xl:tracking-[7.2px] uppercase mb-6">
            Our Commitment to You
          </h2>
          <div class="space-y-6 text-black/70 text-[14px] md:text-[16px] lg:text-[18px] xl:text-[20px] leading-[24px] md:leading-[28px]">
            <p>
              When you choose E5, you're choosing a company that shares your enthusiasm for Corvettes. We're not just wheel manufacturers—we're Corvette enthusiasts who understand why you chose this car and what it means to you. That passion drives everything we do, from the designs we create to the customer experience we deliver.
            </p>
            <p>
              Every set of E5 wheels is backed by a five-year warranty against defects in materials and workmanship, plus a lifetime structural warranty for the original purchaser. This isn't just a policy—it's our promise that when you invest in E5 wheels, you're investing in quality that lasts.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- The E5 Vision Section -->
        <div class="mb-16">
          <h2 class="text-[#d31d25] text-[24px] md:text-[28px] lg:text-[32px] xl:text-[36px] font-['Franklin_Gothic_Demi'] tracking-[4.8px] md:tracking-[5.6px] lg:tracking-[6.4px] xl:tracking-[7.2px] uppercase mb-6">
            The E5 Vision
          </h2>
          <div class="space-y-6 text-black/70 text-[14px] md:text-[16px] lg:text-[18px] xl:text-[20px] leading-[24px] md:leading-[28px]">
            <p>
              Our goal is simple: to elevate your Corvette's style and performance with wheels that embody the spirit of Earth, Water, Air, Fire, and most importantly—Corvette, the fifth element. We don't just build wheels. We build for Corvette owners who demand the best.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Contact Info -->
        <div class="text-center pt-8 border-t-2 border-[#d31d25]">
          <p class="text-black text-[14px] md:text-[16px] lg:text-[18px] xl:text-[20px] font-['Franklin_Gothic_Demi'] tracking-[2px] mb-4">
            E5 Wheels | Doral, Florida
          </p>
          <p class="text-black/70 text-[14px] md:text-[16px] lg:text-[18px] xl:text-[20px] leading-[24px] md:leading-[28px]">
            305-964-7429 | <a href="https://e5wheels.com" class="text-[#d31d25] hover:underline">e5wheels.com</a>
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>
  </div>
</MainLayout>
